g your cake back from the fridge  you're going to unroll it and it will  still have like kind of a it will still  kind of like i don't know go up  because it's like  molded to the roundness  oh man  so then you're just going to lather all  that cheesecake frosting onto  the surface of the cake you're gonna  sprinkle on some strawberries and then  it should be pretty easy from here on  out you just roll the cake back up into  its final form  this is like a shapeshifter  shapeshifter cake i sprinkled my cake  with some more powdered sugar just to  make sure the outside looked nice and  you can also decorate it with some more  like strawberries or maybe some whipped  cream also another important step for  this cake if you're going to be serving  it to people or you want it to look  really beautiful is to chop off the ends  now i know it might seem wasteful but  you're really going to get the best  visual of that swirl when you chop off  the extra bits on end but you also get  that tasty visual  you can just eat them as a snack too  i did  i don't know why i always do this  all of a sudden it's like my signature  [Music]
 

